<BR>	maṉaviru ḷiriya māṇporuṇ muḻuvatum
<BR>	muṉivaṟa varuḷiya mūvaṟu moḻiyuḷum
<BR>	kuṇakaṭal kumari kuṭakam vēṅkaṭam
<BR>	eṉunāṉ kelliyi ṉiruntamiḻk kaṭaluḷ
<BR>	arumporu ḷintiyum yāvaru muṇarat {{10}}
<BR>	tokivaki viriyiṟ ṟarukeṉat tuṉṉār
<BR>	ikalaṟa nūṟi yirunila muḻuvatum
<BR>	taṉateṉak kōlit taṉmata vāraṇam
<BR>	ticitoṟu niṟuviya tiṟaluṟu tolcīrk
<BR>	karuṅkaḻal veṇkuṭik kārnikar vaṇkit {{15}}
