<P>(poḻippuri.) nālvakippūkkaḷiṉāl mikkuṭiya acōkiṉatu taṉelliyi ikavātē eppoḻutum alaṅkariyā niṉṟa niḻalilēeḻuntaruḷiyirunta nāṉmukat toruvaṉi maṉamoḻi meykaḷiṉmakiḻntuṭaṉ vaṇaṅki īriṅkuṟṟamumakaṟṟi īrintaḻakoṭum puṇarntuaritiṉṟi viḷaṅka eḻuttilakkaṇatti yāṉ colluvaṉ e-ṟu.

