<P>iṉi, ivvāṟṟāṟ pakupatamuṭippuḻi,
maliyaṉeṉṉum pakupatamuṭiyumāṟāvatu:- maliyiyuṭiyaṉeṉṉumporuṇmitōṉṟa, "tattam ..pakutiyākum" eṉpataṉāṉē maliyeṉṉumporuṭpakutiyi mutalilvittu ataṉmītē, "aṉ āṉ aḷ āḷ" eṉpataṉāṉēaṉṉeṉṉum vikutiyiniṟuvi, "i ī yivaḻi yavvum" eṉpataṉāṉē iṭiyēyakaravuṭampaṭu meyyi varuvittu, "uṭaṉmē luyirvantoṉṟuvatiyalpē" eṉpataṉāṉē yakarattiṉmēlē vikuti akaratti yēṟṟimuṭikka. maliyateṉpataṟkut tuvveṉṉumvikutimi niṟuvi, "aṉṉāṉiṉṉa laṟṟiṟṟu" eṉpataṉāṉē akaraccāriyiyi iṭiyē tantu, muṉpōluṭampaṭumeyyi varuvittu uyiriyēṟṟi muṭikka. ēṉippāliṭaṅkaḷukkuitaṉmēlē vikutivēṟupāṭallatu vicēṭamilli yeṉka. maliyāṉ,maliyaḷ, maliyāḷ, maliyar, maliyār, maliyēṉ, maliyēṉ,maliyēm, maliyāy, maliyīr eṉa ēṉiyiṭaṅkaḷilumoṭṭikkaṇṭukoḷka.
nilattaṉeṉṉum pakupata muṭiyumāṟāvatu:- ivviṭattaṉe/ṉumporuṇmitōṉṟa, `tattam ... pakutiyākum' eṉpataṉāṉē nilameṉṉumiṭappakutiyi mutalilvittu, ataṉmītē, `aṉ āṉ aḷ āḷ' eṉpataṉāṉēaṉṉeṉṉum vikutiyi niṟuvi, "ilakkiyaṅ kaṇṭataṟkilakkaṇam"eṉpataṉāṉē iṭiyē takariṭiniliyi varuvittu "mavvīṟoṟṟaḻintu"eṉpataṉāṉē makaravīṟṟikkeṭuttu, "iyalpiṉum vitiyiṉu niṉṟavuyirmuṉ, kacatapa mikum" eṉpataṉāṉē takaratti mikuttu,"uṭaṉmēluyir vantu" eṉpataṉāṉē uyiriyēṟṟi nilattaṉeṉa muṭikka.nilattateṉpataṟkut tuvvikutiyiniṟuvi, akaraccāriyiyivaruvittut takarattimikuttu muṉpōla muṭikka. oḻintaṉa muṭipuokkum; vikuti vēṟeṉka: nilattaḷ, nilattar, nilatta, nilattēṉ,nilattēm, nilattāy, nilattīreṉa ellāppāliṭaṅkaḷilum oṭṭuka.
paraṇiyāṉeṉṉum pakupata muṭiyumāṟāvatu :- paraṇināḷiṟpiṟantāṉeṉṉum poruṇmitōṉṟa `muṉpōlap pakutivikuti tantu, `iīaivaḻi yavvum' eṉpataṉāṉ yakaravuṭampaṭumeyyi varuvittu uyirēṟṟimuṭikka. paraṇiyatu eṉpataṟku, muṉpōlat tuvveṉṉum vikutiyumakaraccāriyiyum uṭampaṭumeyyuṅ koṭuttu uyirēṟṟi muṭikka.paraṇiyāḷ, paraṇiyār eṉa ēṉippāliṭaṅkaḷilum oṭṭikkoḷka.
mārpāṉeṉṉum pakupatam muṭiyumāṟāvatu:- ivvuṟuppiyuṭiyāṉeṉṉumporuṇmitōṉṟa, tattam...pakutiyākum" eṉpataṉāṉē mārpeṉṉumciṉippakutiyi mutalilvittu, "aṉ āṉ" eṉpataṉālāṉvikutiyiniṟuvi, "uyirvari ṉukkuṟaṇ meyviṭṭōṭum" eṉpataṉāṉēkuṟṟukarattikkeṭuttu, "uṭaṉmē luyirvan toṉṟuva tiyalpē"eṉpataṉāṉē uyirēṟṟi mārpāṉeṉa muṭikka. mārpatu eṉpataṟkuttuvveṉṉum vikutiyiyum akaraccāriyiyum tantu ukaraṅkeṭuttuuyirēṟṟimuṭikka. mārpāḷ, mārpāreṉa ēṉippāliṭaṅkaḷiṉumoṭṭikkoḷka.
kariyaṉeṉṉum pakupatam muṭiyumāṟāvatu:- inniṟattiyuṭiyāṉeṉṉumporuṇmitōṉṟa "cemmi ciṟumi" eṉṉum cūttirattāṟ karumiyeṉṉumpaṇpuppakutiyi mutalilvittu, "aṉṉāṉ eṉpataṉāṉē aṉṉeṉṉumvikutiyi niṟuvi, "īṟupōta liṭiyukaramiyyātal" eṉpataṉāṟpakutiyatu īṟṟuyir meyyikkeṭuttu ukaratti ikaramākkiuṭampaṭumeyyi varuvittu uṭaṉmēluyirēṟṟi muṭikka. kariyatueṉpataṟku, tuvvikutiyum akaraccāriyiyum yakaravuṭampaṭumeyyumkoṭuttu muṭikka. kariyaḷ, kariyar, kariyaṉa, kariyēṉ, kariyēm,kariyāy, kariyīr eṉa ēṉippāliṭaṅkaḷilum oṭṭikkoḷka.
ūṇaṉ eṉṉum pakupatam muṭiyumāṟāvatu:- ittoḻiliyuṭiyāṉeṉṉumporuṇmi tōṉṟa, "tattam ...pakutiyākum" eṉpataṉāṉē, ūṇeṉṉumtoḻiṟpakutiyi muṉvittu, ataṉmītē "aṉṉāṉ" eṉpataṉāṉē aṉṉeṉṉumvikutiyiniṟuvi, "uṭaṉmēl ... iyalpē" eṉpataṉāl, uṭaṉmēluyirēṟṟimuṭikka. ūṇatu eṉpataṟku, tuvvikutiyiyum akaraccāriyiyum tantumuṭikka. ūṇaḷ, ūṇar eṉa ēṉippāliṭaṅkaḷilum oṭṭikkoḷka.
naṭantāṉeṉṉum poḻutukoḷ viṉippakupatam muṭiyumāṟāvatu:- "naṭavāmaṭicī viṭukū" eṉpataṉāṉē naṭaveṉṉum pakutiyi muṉvittu,ataṉmītē, "aṉṉāṉaḷḷāḷ" eṉpataṉāṉē āṉeṉṉum vikutiyi niṟuvi,"taṭaṟavoṟṟiṉṉē" eṉpataṉāṉē iṭiyē takara iṭiniliyivaruvittu,"iyalpiṉum vitiyiṉum" eṉpataṉāṉē takaratti mikuttu, "valittaṉmelitta ṉīṭṭal kuṟukkal" eṉpataṉāṉē takaratti nakaramākkiuṭaṉmēluyirēṟṟi naṭantāṉeṉamuṭikka. naṭantatu eṉpataṟkuttuvvikutiyiyum akaraccāriyiyuṅ koṭuttut takaravoṟṟi varuvittuttakarattimikuttut takaravoṟṟi nakaramāka melittu muṭikka.naṭantāḷ, naṭantār eṉa ēṉippāliṭaṅkaḷilum oṭṭikkoḷka.
naṭattiṉāṉeṉpataṟku, "viḷampiya pakutivē ṟātalum vitiyē"eṉpataṉāṉē, naṭattu eṉṉum pakutiyiyākki āṉ vikutiyi niṟuvi iṉeṉṉum iṭinilikoṭuttu ukaraṅkeṭuttu uyirēṟṟimuṭikka.naṭattuvittāṉeṉpataṟku, "ceyyeṉ viṉivaḻivippi taṉivariṉ"eṉpataṉāṉē naṭattuvi eṉṉum pakutiyi ākki, āṉvikutiyi niṟuvittakaraviṭiniliyi varuvittu, "iyalpiṉum vitiyiṉum" eṉpataṉāṉētakaratti iraṭṭittu uyirēṟṟimuṭikka. vantāṉeṉpataṟku"naṭavāmaṭi" eṉpataṉāṉ, vā eṉ pakutiyi mutalilvittu ataṉi,"viḷampiya ... vitiyē" eṉpataṉāṉ vam eṉṟākki āṉvikutiyi niṟuvi,"taṭaṟaṭavoṟṟiṉṉē" eṉpataṉāṉē takaraviṭiniliyivaruvittu,"mavvī ṟoṟṟaḻintuyirī ṟoppavum" eṉpataṉāṉē makaratti nakaramākkivantāṉeṉa muṭikka. varuvittāṉeṉpataṟku, "viḷampiyapakuti"eṉpataṉāṉ, vāveṉpati varu eṉṟākki, "ceyyeṉviṉivaḻi" eṉpataṉāṉēvaruvi eṉpatu pakutiyākki, āṉvikutiyum takaraviṭi niliyumtantu, "iyalpiṉum vitiyiṉum ... mikum" eṉpataṉāṉē takarattiiraṭṭittu uyirēṟṟi muṭikka.
ivviṉippatamē viṉippeyarām. avi eṭuttal paṭuttalōcikaḷālaṟintukoḷka. piṟavum iṅṅaṉamuṭikka.

<P>iṉi, aracuttoḻiliyuṭiyāṉ aracaṉ, vāṇikamuṭiyāṉ vāṇikaṉ,uḻaviyuṭiyāṉ uḻavaṉ, vēḷāṇmi ceyvāṉ vēḷāḷaṇ,kaṇakkālmuyaṉṟuṇpāṉ kaṇakkaṉ, kuntat toḻiluṇpāṉ kuntavaṉ,valiyālmuyaṉṟuṇpāṉ valiyaṉ, uvaccattoḻilāl muyaṉṟuṇpāṉ uvaccaṉ,taccattoḻilāl muyaṉṟuṇpāṉ taccaṉ, vaṇṇārattoḻilāl muyaṉṟuṇpāṉvaṇṇāṉ, kaṇavāḷattoḻilāl muyaṉṟuṇpāṉ kaṇavāḷaṉeṉṟu ivvāṟēāṇpāṟpeyarp pakupataṅkaḷellām muṭikka.
peṇpāṟpeyarp pakupatam muṭippuḻaṭa, iṉṉakulattāḷeṉṉumporuṇmitōṉṟa muṭikka. araciyeṉṉum pakupata muṭiyumāṟāvatu:-"tattam ... pakutiyākum" eṉpataṉāṉē aracu eṉṉum pakutiyit tantu,"aṉṉāṉ" eṉpataṉāṉē ikaravikutiyi niṟuvi, "uyirvariṉuk kuṟaḷ"eṉpataṉāṉē ukarattik keṭuttuc cakaravoṟṟiṉmēl "uṭaṉmēluyirvantu"eṉpataṉāṉē ikaravuyiriyēṟṟi muṭikka.
pārppaṉiyeṉṉum pakupatam muṭiyumamāṟāvatu:- `tattam pakāppatam'eṉpataṉāṉē pārppāṉeṉṉum pakutiyi mutalvittu, ataṉi"viḷampiyapakuti" eṉpataṉāṉē pārppaṉeṉa aṉṉīṟākki, aṉṉāṉ"eṉpataṉāṉē ikaravikutiyik koṇarntu uyirēṟṟi muṭikka.
vāṇicciyeṉṉum pakupatam muṭiyumāṟāvatu:- vāṇikaṉ eṉṉum pakutiyi,"viḷampiyapakuti" eṉpataṉāṉē kaṉkeṭuttu niṟuvi ikara vikutiyikkoṇarntu, c eṉṉum iṭiniliyi varuvittu ataṉi mikuvittuuyirēṟṟimuṭikka.
uḻattiyeṉṉum pakupatam muṭiyumāṟāvatu:- uḻavaṉ eṉṉum pakutiyi,"viḷampiya pakuti" eṉpataṉāṉē vaṉkeṭuttuniṟuvi ikaravikutikoṇarntu, "ilakkiyaṅ kaṇṭataṟ kilakkaṇa miyampaliṉ" eṉpataṉāṉētakaraviṭiniliyi varuvittu ataṉimikuttu uyirēṟṟi muṭikka.
taccicciyeṉṉum pakupatam muṭiyumāṟāvatu:- taccaṉ eṉṉum pakutiyiaṉkeṭuttuniṟuvi ikaravikutiyik koṇarntu, "ilakkiyaṅ kaṇṭataṟku"eṉpataṉāṉ icceṉṉumiṭiniliyi varuvittu uyirēṟṟi muṭikka.
ivvāṟē ellāp pakupataṅkaḷiyum pakutimutalāṉa karuvikaḷ tantuēṟṟavāṟu muṭikka.

