<P><B>((VIRI)):</B> va-ṟu. nampi naṅki cāttaṉ cātti nilam nīrmaṇi poṉ; vantāṉ vantāḷ vantār, pōṉāṉ pōṉāḷ pōṉār, vantatuvantaṉa; til maṉ; tañcam tava eṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa oru moḻikaḷ.

<P>iṉi, toṭarmoḻiyāvatu toṭarntamoḻi, toṭaralāvatu moḻikaḷ tammuṭporuḷnōkkuṭiyavātal; nōkkuṭimiyāvatu tokinilivakiyāṉumtokānilivakiyāṉum tammuṭ poruḷ koṇṭumuṟṟal. avi yāṅṅaṉamporuḷkoṇṭu muṟṟumōveṉiṉ, aṭi, poruḷkoṇṭu muṟṟum; potu,ciṟappukkoṇṭumuṟṟum; peyar, viṉiyumpeyarum viṉāvuṅkoṇṭu muṟṟum;terinilimuṟṟum kuṟippumuṟṟum peyareccamum, peyarkoṇṭumuṟṟum;viṉiyeccam, muṟṟuviṉiyum peyareccaviṉiyum toḻiṟpeyarumciṟupāṉmiviṉiyeccamuṅkoṇṭumuṟṟum; iṭiccollum uriccollumurupukaḷum, peyarum viṉiyuṅkoṇṭumuṟṟum. avaṟṟuḷ, aṭi poruḷkoṇṭumuṟṟumāṟu pārppāṉ pārāyaṇaṉeṉpatu; ivvāṟē oḻintaṉavum tattamviticcūttiraṅkaḷuṭkāṇka. iṉi, kuṟiñcimalar, "kuṉṟakkūki" (kuṟun.153) kolyāṉi, kuḷirmati; karuṅkutiri, peruṅkuḷir; kuyiṉmoḻi,mayiliyal; kapilaparaṇar, kikāl; poṟṟoṭi, puṉikōtieṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa tokinilit toṭarmoḻikaḷ koṟṟaṉi, koṟṟaṉāl,koṟṟaṟku, koṟṟaṉil, koṟṟaṉatu, koṟṟaṉkaṇ; ōṇaṉuṇṭāṉ, koṟṟākoḷ,uṇṭacāttaṉ, uṇṭuvantāṉ, uṇṭāṉūraṉ, pūṇaṉpoṉṉaṉ. "atuko ṟōḻikāmanōyē" (kuṟun. 5), "naṉipē tiyē nayaṉil kūṟṟam" (puṟanā.227), vantēṉ vantēṉeṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa, tokānilit toṭarmoḻikaḷ.
oru colmuṉ orucol varuṅkāl tokinili tokāniliyākiya ivviraṇṭaṉpakutikaḷuḷ oṉṟupaṟṟiyaṉṟi vārāteṉakkoḷka.
eṭṭu, koṭṭu, koṇmū, tāmari, vēṅki, kuṟuñcūli, āṉi vaṇakki,muyaṉmōvāy, mutiyāḷkūntal, ciṟiyāṇaṅki, eḻuntiruntāṉ,vārāniṉṟāṉ, urittiṭṭāṉeṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa, pakātu niṉṟu orupeyarumviṉiyumāy oruporuḷi yuṇarttiṉaveṉalumāy, avvāṟaṉṟi, eḷḷittu,koḷḷittu, koḷḷimū, tāvukiṉṟamari, vēkiṉṟaki, kuṟitākiyacūliṉiyuṭiyavaḷ, āṉiyi vaṇakkuvāṉ, muyaliṉatumōvāy,mutiyāḷatu kūntal, ciṟiyāḷākiya naṅki, eḻuntu piṉ iruntāṉ,vantupiṉ niṉṟāṉ, urittup piṉ iṭṭāṉeṉa ivvāṟupakuppap palaporuḷiyuṇarttiṉaveṉalumāy niṟṟalāṟ potumoḻikaḷ. veṟpaṉ, poruppaṉ,kuḻiyaṉ, kariyaṉeṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa palaporuḷuṇarttiṉaveṉiṉum,avi toṭarmoḻikaḷākā; pakupatamāmeṉka. pakupatattiṟkumtoṭarmoḻikkum tammuḷ vēṟṟumi mēliyatikārattuṭ (cū. 5, uri)pataviyaluṭkāṇka. cēṉi, kuḻām, toṟu, pala, palar, cila, cilar,vantār, vantaṉaveṉpaṉavum poruḷpalavēṉum poruḷiyipākiyaoruporuḷi uṇarttalāṉ orumoḻiyēyāmeṉka; "palavi ṉiyintavumoṉṟeṉap paṭumē, aṭicil pottakañ cēṉi yaminta, katava mālikampala maṉiya" eṉṟār āciriyar akattiyaṉāru meṉak koḷka.
itaṟku ivvāṟaṉṟi, orumoḻiyāka, toṭarmoḻiyāka oruporuḷit taruvaṉaorumoḻi; palaporuḷit taruvaṉa toṭarmoḻi; oru poruḷatākakkoḷḷavumpalaporuḷatākak koḷḷavum varuvaṉa potumoḻiyeṉṟumām. avaṉ, cāttaṉ,koṟṟaṉ, nilam, nīr; vantāṉ, ceṉṟāṉ, vantatu, niṉṟatu; til, maṉ;tañcam, tava eṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa taṉiyēniṉṟu oruporuḷtantaorumoḻikaḷ. avarkaḷ, palar, cilar, avi, pala, cila, cēṉi,kuḻām, toṟu, vantaṉa, pōyiṉaveṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa taṉiyēniṉṟupalaporuḷtanta toṭarmoḻikaḷ. avar, aracar, vantāreṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa oruvari uyarttuccolliyavaḻi orumoḻiyeṉalumāyppalari nutaliyavaḻit toṭarmoḻiyeṉalumāy niṟṟaliṉ, taṉiyēniṉṟapotumoḻikaḷ. cēraṉ tirumaṇakkuṭṭuvaṉ, cōḻaṉ karikāṟperuvaḷattāṉ,pāṇṭiyaṉ neṭuñceḻiyaṉ eṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa toṭarmoḻiyāy niṉṟuoruporuḷ tanta orumoḻi. koṟṟimakaṉ, "kuṉṟakkūki" (kuṟun. 153),uvāppatiṉāṉku, patiṉoṉṟu eṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa toṭarmoḻiyāyniṉṟupalaporuḷtanta toṭar moḻittoṭarmoḻikaḷ. eṭṭu, koṭṭu, koṇmū,vēṅki eṉṟaṟ ṟoṭakkattaṉa toṭarmoḻiyāyniṉṟu pala poruḷtantaeṉalumāy, oru moḻiyāyniṉṟu oruporuḷtanta eṉalumāyniṉṟa toṭarmoḻippotumoḻikaḷ. ivvirutiṟamum aṟintukoḷka.
ivvāṟunōkkap poruḷāṉē coṟkuk kuṟiyiṭṭavāṟum āyiṟṟeṉka.

