<P><B>e-ṉ,</B> mēl, "iyaṟcol" eṉṟār, aḵtu iḵteṉpatuṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P><B>((WFW)):</B> centamiḻnilattu moḻiyāyc collāṉumporuḷāṉumtiripiṉṟik kaṟṟārkkum kallātārkkumoppat tamporuḷviḷakkumiyalpiṉiyuṭiyaṉa iyaṟcollāvaṉa e-ṟu.

<P><B>((VIRI)):</B> va-ṟu. avaṉ, avaḷ, makaṉ, makaḷ, makkaḷ,māntar, uṭampu, uṟuppu, poṉ, maṇi, muttu, māli, maṇal, nīr,neruppu, kāṟṟu, cōṟu, puṭivi, yāṉi, kutiri, mayil, kuyil, mā,palā, teṅku, kamuku e-m, nilam, maṇ, taṟi, mēṭu, paḷḷam, kuḷam,kuḻi, yāṟu, kaṭal e-m, yāṇṭu, paruvam, tiṅkaḷ, iṉṟu, nāḷi, irā,pakal e-m, tali, mukam, kaṇ, kātu, ki, kāl, kompu, koḻuntu,ili, pū, kāy, paḻam, vēr e-m, uṇarvu, oḷi, kaṟuppu, civappu,vaṭṭam, caturam, vemmi, taṇmi, kippu, puḷippu, tuvarppu,uvarppu, uṟippu, oppu, polivu e-m, niṟṟal, iruttal, kiṭattal,naṭattal, ōṭal, pāṭal, koḷḷal, koṭuttal e-m poruḷātiyāṟuporuḷiyum peyariyaṟcol viḷakkiṉavāṟu. uṇṭāṉ, uṟaṅkiṉāṉ, niṉṟāṉ,niṉintāṉ, eḻutiṉāṉ, ōtiṉāṉ, pārttāṉ, paḻittāṉ, vantāṉ pōṉāṉ eṉaviṉiyiyaṟ col vantavāṟu. maṟṟu, maṟṟi, piṟa ṉeiṭiyiyaṟcolvantavāṟu. kuḻakkaṉṟu (nālaṭi. 101), uppukkūrttatu,alamantu tiriyāniṉṟāṉ, atirntiruntāṉ, nōytīrntatu eṉa uriyiyaṟcolvantavāṟu. piṟavum ivvāṟē vaḻaṅkumiyaṟ coṟkaḷellām ārāyntukoḷka.

<P><B>{{pi-m}}</B> kūrppu, kāḻppu, tittippu poruḷātiyāṟumpeyariyaṟ col alantu


<HR>
<A NAME="_NAma_271"><H4>271</H4></A>
<P>	oruporuḷ kuṟitta palacol lākiyum
