<P><B>e-ṉ,</B> mēlniṟuttamuṟiyāṉē tiricollāvaṉa uṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P><B>((WFW)):</B> oruporuḷikkarutiya palacollākiyum,palaporuḷik karutiya orucollākiyum, kallātārkku aṟiyalākāpporuḷavāvaṉa tiricol e-ṟu.

<P><B>((VIRI)):</B> iccolliṟku vēṟōriyaṟcoṟ koṭuvantu tirittuccollavēṇṭutalāl, tiricolleṉakkoḷka. itaṟkup piṟavāṟucolluvārumuḷar.

<P><B>va-ṟu.</B> veṟpu, vilaṅkal, viṇṭu, aṭukkal, poṟṟi, poruppu, poṟi,aṟi, naviram, kuṉṟu, kuvaṭu, vari, cilampu, ōṅkal e-m, paṭi,pār, puṭavi, poḻil, iṭam e-m, elli, kaṅkul, alkal, al e-m,koṅki, kurūkkaṇ, kuyam, vallu e-m, cuṇaṅku, tutti, utti,titali, toyyil e-m, tuyttal, micital, nukartal, ayiṟal e-m ivimuṟiyē poruḷātiyāṟaṉuḷ, oruporuḷkarutiya pala peyarttiricol.cāttaṉē, vantāyē; kūttaṉō, vantāyō e-m, "ōo vuvama ṉuṟaḻviṉṟiyottatē" (kaḷavaḻi. 36), "kuṟavaru maruḷuṅ kuṉṟam" (malipaṭu.275), e-m varumivi viṉā orumiyiṉum uyarvu ciṟapporumiyiṉumvanta palaviṭittiricol. uṟu, tava, naṉi, kaḻi eṉumivimikutiyorumiyittaḻuviya pala urittiricol. piṟavumaṉṉa.

<P>iṉip palaporuḷkuṟitta orupeyarttiricol varumāṟu: unti, ōṭi,naṟavam, vāraṇam eṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa. ivaṟṟuḷ, untiyeṉpatukoppūḻiṉiyum āṟṟiṭikkuṟiyiṉiyum tērttaṭṭiṉiyumyāḻppattaṟṟuḷiyiṉiyumuṇarttum. ōṭiyeṉpatu yāṉippaṭṭattiṉiyumorumarattiṉiyum orukoṭiyiṉiyum nīrniliyiṉiyu muṇarttum.naṟavameṉpatu kaḷḷiṉiyum orukoṭiyiṉiyu muṇarttum. vāraṇameṉpatukōḻiyiṉiyum, paṉṟiyiṉiyum, yāṉiyiṉiyum, caṅkiṉiyumuṇarttum.tuñciṉār, otuṅkiṉār, māṇṭatu eṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa, palatoḻil kuṟittaoru toḻiṟṟiricol; ivaṟṟuḷ, tuñciṉāreṉpatu uṟaṅkiṉāreṉpataṉiyumiṟantāreṉpataṉiyu muṇarttum. otuṅkiṉāreṉpatunaṭantāreṉpataṉiyum oṭuṅkiṉāreṉpataṉiyum uṇarttum. māṇṭateṉpatumāṭcimippaṭṭa teṉpataṉiyum māyntateṉpataṉiyum uṇarttum.piṟavumaṉṉa. til, maṉ, maṟṟu, kol eṉṟaṟṟoṭakkattaṉa palaporuḷkarutiya ōriṭittiricol. `kaṭiyeṉkiḷavi' mutalāyiṉapalakuṇantaḻuviya ōrurittiricol. piṟavumaṉṉa.

<P><B>{{pi-m}}</B> tiricollāvaṉa uvami naṟaveṉpatu.


<HR>
<A NAME="_NAma_272"><H4>272</H4></A>
<P>	centamiḻ nilaccēr paṉṉiru nilattiṉum
<BR>	oṉpatiṟ ṟiraṇṭiṉiṟ ṟamiḻoḻi nilattiṉum
<BR>	taṅkuṟip piṉavē ticicco leṉpa.

<P><B>e-ṉ,</B> mēl niṟuttamuṟiyāṉē, muṉṉiṉṟa iyaṟcollumtiricollumuṇartti, avaṟṟiṉpakutiyāy iṭiyil niṉṟavaṟṟittattamōttukkaḷuḷ uṇarttiyaniṟīi eñciyaviraṇṭiṉuḷ ticic collāmāṟuuṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

