<P><B>va-ṟu.</B> kuḻiyiṉaṉ, kuḻiyiṉaḷ, kuḻiyiṉar, kuḻiyiṟṟu,kuḻiyiṉa; kuḻiyiṉēṉ, kuḻiyiṉēm; kuḻiyiṉi, kuḻiyiṉīr e-m,akattiṉaṉ, akattiṉaḷ, akattiṉar, akattatu, akattaṉa; akattiṉēṉ,akattiṉēm; akattiṉi, akattiṉīr e-m, nāḷiṉaṉ, nāḷiṉaḷ, nāḷiṉar,nāḷiṟṟu, nāḷiṉa; nāḷiṉēṉ, nāḷiṉēm; nāḷiṉi, nāḷiṉīr e-m,kaṇṇiṉaṉ, kaṇṇiṉaḷ, kaṇṇiṉar, kaṇṇiṟṟu, kaṇṇiṉa; kaṇṇiṉēṉ,kaṇṇiṉēm; kaṇṇiṉi, kaṇṇiṉīr e-m, kariyaṉ, kariyaḷ , kariyar,kariyatu, kariyaṉa; kariyēṉ, kariyēm; kariyi, kariyīr e-m,celaviṉaṉ, celaviṉaḷ, celaviṉar, celaviṟṟu, celaviṉa; celaviṉēṉ,celaviṉēm; celaviṉi, celaviṉīr e-m muṟiyē kāṇka.

