<A NAME="_NAma_323"><H4>323</H4></A>
<P>	oruvaṉmuta lintiyum paṭarkki yiṭattum
<BR>	orumi paṉmiyit taṉmimuṉ ṉiliyiṉum
<BR>	mukkā lattiṉu muraṇa muṟiyē
<BR>	mūvin tirumūṉ ṟāṟāy muṟṟu
<BR>	5 viṉippata moṉṟē mūvoṉ pāṉām.

<P><B>e-ṉ,</B> muṟṟuviṉiyiṉ vakiyum tokiyumuṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

