<P>	ceyyume ṉeccavīṟ ṟuyirmey cēṟalum
<BR>	ceyyuḷu ḷummun tākalu muṟṟēl
<BR>	uyiru muyirmeyyu mēkalu muḷavē.

<P><B>e-ṉ,</B> peyareccattiṟkum muṟṟiṟkum āvatōr vitiyuṇarttutalnutaliṟṟu.

<P><B>((WFW)):</B> ceyyumeṉṉum peyareccaccoṟkaḷuṭ cila moḻiyīṟṟu uyirmeykeṭutalum, ceyyuḷuṭcila ummi unteṉṟātalum, ceyyumeṉṉumuṟṟuviṉiccolluṭ cila īṟṟuyirēkalum, cila īṟṟuyirmey ēkalumuḷae-ṟu.

<P><B>((VIRI)):</B> 
ummiyāṉ, ivi ivvāṟātal orutaliyaṉṟeṉak koḷka.

<P><B>va-ṟu.</B> "āmporuḷka ḷākumavi yārkkumaḻik koṇṇā" (cīvaka.848), "pōmpuḻi", "vāmpuravi vaḻuti" (yā. vi. cū. 95, mēṟ.), eṉaivi uyirmey keṭṭaṉa; ivi makaravoṟṟuniṟṟalāṉ,viṉittokiyākāveṉka. "nellariyu miruntoḻuvar, ceññāyiṟṟuveyiṉmuṉiyiṟ ṟeṇkaṭaṟṟiri micippāyuntu, tiṇṭimil vaṉparatavar"(puṟanā. 24), "nīrkkōḻi kūuyp peyark kuntu" (puṟanā. 395) eṉaivi um unteṉṟāyiṉa. "cāraṉāṭaveṉ ṟōḻiyuṅ kaluḻmē", "ampa lūrumavaṉoṭu moḻimē" (kuṟun. 51), "āa meṉakkeḷiteṉ ṟaṉṟulakamāṇṭavaṉ" (paḻa. 7) eṉa muṟṟuccol uyirum uyirmeyyum keṭṭaṉa.piṟavumaṉṉa.

<P><B>{{pi-m}}</B> ākum, pōkum, vāvumeṉṟa uyirmey


<HR>
<A NAME="_NAma_341"><H4>341</H4></A>
<P>	toḻiluṅ kālumun tōṉṟip pālviṉi
<BR>	oḻiya niṟpatu viṉiyec cammē.

