<HR>
<A NAME="_NAma_379"><H4>379</H4></A>
<P>	orumiyiṟ paṉmiyum paṉmiyi ṉorumiyum
<BR>	ōriṭam piṟaviṭan taḻuvulu muḷavē.

<P><B>e-ṉ,</B> pāliṭa vaḻuvamippu uṇarttutal nutaliṟṟu.

<P><B>((WFW)):</B> orumiccol paṉmitaḻuvalum, paṉmiccolorumitaḻuvalum ōriṭattukku uriyacol piṟaviṭaṅkaḷ taḻuvalum uḷavām e-ṟu.

<P><B>((VIRI)):</B> ippāṉmayakkam muṉṉuritta uvappumutalāyiṉa allātavaḻivaruvateṉakkoḷka.

<P><B>va-ṟu.</B> nīriruntaṉa, pāliruntaṉa e-m, nāṭellām vāḻntatu, ūrellāmuvantatu, cōṟumāṇṭatu, paṭivantatu, cāttuvantatu, kaṇcivantatu,mulivīṅkiṟṟu, "irunōk kivaḷuṇka ṇuḷḷatu" (kuṟaḷ. 1091), "uḷḷiyatellā muṭaṉeytum" (kuṟaḷ. 309) e-m ivi aḵṟiṇiyorumiyuṭaṉpaṉmiyum, paṉmiyuṭaṉ orumiyumayaṅkiṉa. "akuti tanti, yaṇṇalyāṉi yaṭupōrc cōḻar" (akanā. 96) "vaḻipaṭu teyva niṟpuṟaṅ kāppa... polimiṉeṉṉum puṟanili vāḻttē" (tol. cey. 110), "kalampeṟukaṇṇuḷa rokkaṟṟaliva, ... poḻutetirnta, puḷḷiṉir maṉṟa veṉṟākkuṟutaliṉ, ... patamikap peṟukuvīr ... oruvi roruvi rōmpiṉirkaḻimiṉ" (malipaṭu. 50, 65 - 6, 157, 218), yāṉ emmūrpukuval e-m,"puliya ṉeṟinta pūcaṟ ṟaṇṇumi, ēvaliḷiyar tāyvayiṟu karippa"e-m uyartiṇiyorumiyiṟ paṉmiyum, paṉmiyiṉ orumiyum mayaṅkiṉa.

<P>iṉi iṭamayakkam:-cāttaṉṟāy ivi ceyvalō, "kalviyeṉṉum vallāṇciṟāaṉ, olvē ṉalla ṉatuvā yākutal" (puṟanā. 346), "āventivacumittā vaḻāniṉṟa vivaṉiyu, māveṉṟa nōkkiyiyu mātaramputalvaṉiyum, vīyviṉṟu tuṇiyāyniṉ viṟaliḻiyoṭunōkkāy, vēyniṉṟaviyaṉkāṭṭuḷ viṭṭeṟin tiṟattiyō", "nillātu peyarnta pallō ruḷḷum,eṉṉē kuṟitta nōkkamoṭu" (akanā. 110) eṉavarumivi taṉmipaṭarkki taḻīiyiṉa.
"tiṇporu ḷeyta lākun tevvaric cekukka lāku, naṇpoṭu peṇṭirmakkaḷ yāviyu naṇṇa lākum, oṇporu ḷāva tiyāvuṭaṉpiṟap pākkalākā, empiyi yīṅkup peṟṟē ṉeṉṉeṉakkariya teṉṟāṉ" (cīvaka. 1760)eṉpatu muṉṉili paṭarkki taḻīiyiṟṟu.
